  m_Text: '1. position bowler

    by moving the mouse left / right


    2. grab
    the ball

    click on the ball and hold the mouse down


    3. throw the ball

    drag
    the mouse down, then up quickly and release it at

    the top of the screen.
    roll the mouse fast to throw that ball!


    4. steer the ball ( very important!
    )

    you can steer the ball as it rolls down the lane!

    move the mouse
    to the left of the screen to spin left.

    move the mouse to the right of the
    screen to spin right.

    try different balls - the higher the spin, the more
    it steers.'
